<section class="lt-faq-section">
  <div class="lt-faq-container">

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <p class="lt-faq-subtitle">Everything you’d like to know before trying Lithella.</p>

    <div class="lt-faq-list">

      <details>
        <summary>How does Lithella work?</summary>
        <p>Lithella is a wireless heated belt designed to keep you company on your period days. Once it’s on, choose the heat level you like and use it without boiling a kettle or staying stuck in bed or on the sofa.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>How long does it take to heat up?</summary>
        <p>Lithella starts warming up as soon as you switch it on and reaches your chosen temperature in under 30 seconds.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I adjust the temperature?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Lithella has 5 heat levels, so you can adjust the warmth to what feels right at different points in your cycle.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>How long does the battery really last?</summary>
        <p>You can choose a 15 or 30-minute session; when it ends, the belt switches itself off. To carry on, just switch it back on and wait 30 seconds. The automatic switch-off is a safety feature. A single charge lasts up to 5 hours.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>How long does it take to charge?</summary>
        <p>A full charge takes about 1 hour.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I use it while I work or study?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Lithella is designed to give you comforting heat without having to sit still. Wear it while you work at your computer, study, relax at home or go about everyday activities where it’s safe to use.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can you see it under clothes?</summary>
        <p>Lithella is compact and discreet, but how visible it is depends on what you’re wearing. Under very fitted clothes it may show a little.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Is the belt adjustable?</summary>
        <p>Yes. The strap adjusts to fit comfortably on every body type.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I use it on my lower back?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Lithella can be worn on your lower back, your tummy and even your legs. Always follow the instructions that come with the product.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Is it safe to use?</summary>
        <p>We recommend wearing it with a layer of fabric, such as a top or jumper, between your skin and the heating pad, although it can also be worn against the skin. Always follow the instructions that come with the product.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I wear it directly on my skin?</summary>
        <p>Yes, the belt can be worn directly on the skin. Heat tolerance varies from person to person, so depending on the temperature you choose, you may prefer to wear it over a thin layer of fabric.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I sleep with Lithella on?</summary>
        <p>Thanks to the automatic switch-off, you can use Lithella at night too.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I turn the massage off?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Massage and heat can be used separately, whichever you prefer.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>How do I clean it?</summary>
        <p>As it contains electronic parts, it shouldn’t be washed like normal clothing. You’ll find cleaning instructions in the box.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I use it if I have endometriosis or very strong pain?</summary>
        <p>Lithella is designed to give comfort through heat, but it doesn’t replace diagnosis, treatment or medical advice. If your pain is severe, persistent, sudden or stops you from getting on with your day, please speak to a healthcare professional.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
        <p>Orders are prepared within 1–3 business days. You’ll see the estimated delivery time at checkout and in your order confirmation email.</p>
      </details>


      <details>
        <summary>Can I return it if it’s not for me?</summary>
        <p>Yes. If Lithella isn’t right for you, you can request a return under the terms of our refund policy.</p>
      </details>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<style>

.lt-faq-section {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  padding: 55px 14px;
  font-family: inherit;
}

.lt-faq-container {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}


/* TITLE */

.lt-faq-container h2 {
  text-align: center;
  color: #4B2834;
  font-size: 38px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin: 0 0 10px;
}


/* SUBTITLE */

.lt-faq-subtitle {
  text-align: center;
  color: #6F5B60;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  margin: 0 auto 30px;
}


/* FAQ LIST */

.lt-faq-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}


/* FAQ CARD */

.lt-faq-list details {
  background: rgba(239, 199, 196, .16);
  border: 1px solid rgba(239, 199, 196, .55);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: all .2s ease;
}

.lt-faq-list details[open] {
  background: rgba(239, 199, 196, .23);
}


/* QUESTION */

.lt-faq-list summary {
  cursor: pointer;
  list-style: none;

  padding: 18px 48px 18px 20px;

  color: #4B2834;

  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 800;

  position: relative;
}

.lt-faq-list summary::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}


/* PLUS / MINUS */

.lt-faq-list summary::after {
  content: "+";

  position: absolute;
  right: 20px;
  top: 50%;

  transform: translateY(-50%);

  color: #EFC7C4;

  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.lt-faq-list details[open] summary::after {
  content: "−";
}


/* ANSWER */

.lt-faq-list details p {
  padding: 0 20px 18px;
  margin: 0;

  color: #6F5B60;

  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}


/* MOBILE */

@media(max-width: 768px) {

  .lt-faq-section {
    padding: 42px 12px;
  }

  .lt-faq-container h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
  }

  .lt-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .lt-faq-list summary {
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 16px 42px 16px 16px;
  }

  .lt-faq-list summary::after {
    right: 16px;
  }

  .lt-faq-list details p {
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 0 16px 16px;
  }

}

</style>

